			"date": "2024-06-07T16:02:16.456Z",
			"content": "<p>Thinking about 🔢 Defcon levels of software consent patterns:</p><p>1️⃣ Defcon 1: Opt-in without asking (new default), opt-out not allowed.<br />2️⃣ Defcon 2: Opt-in without asking, opt-out allowed via user action<br />3️⃣ Defcon 3: Ask for opt-in via prompt with default yes already selected<br />4️⃣ Defcon 4: Opt-in via non-default user action (manual installation)<br />5️⃣ Defcon 5: Thing not added, requiring no action by anyone 😅</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
